{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1477197-callings-and-active-knacks","id":1477197,"title":"Callings and active Knacks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-24T06:07:10-07:00","id":1477197,"title":"Callings and active Knacks","content":"Does anyone use this rule or do you let your players have free access to their Knacks?<br /> And I you use it, do you relate the Calling's dots to the number of active Knacks, If the character has 2 dots in Guardian, they can only have 2 Guardian Knacks active?<br /> And how about Immortal Knacks, do they count as two active Knacks or only one, like Heroic Knacks?<br /> <br /> This rule seemed pointless at first, as my players didn't have more Knacks then dots, but as the game progressed it became more relevent. But still like a tedious and annoying rule, that didn't help the flow of the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-24T09:23:13-07:00","id":1477223,"title":"","content":"In terms of buying Knacks with XP, Heroic and Immortal cost the same. In terms of ones you can have active, Immortal Knacks take up two slots. (This still applies to the Immortal Knacks in the Demigod manuscript, even if some of them might seem like they're more geared to higher-Legend characters.)<br /> <br /> If players are finding that working out their active Knacks before a game session is bothersome, I'd recommend the optional rule that you can activate Knacks in play instead of having to choose in advance. So long as they're ones you know and don't go over the number of slots you're allowed by your Calling dots, you can switch them around every session. It gives players a reason to spend some XP on things that they might now need on a regular basis and pull them out when a session calls for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Scion 2E</b> Freelancer: <i>Origin; Hero; Demigod; God; Mythical Denizens; Mysteries of the World; Saints &amp; Monsters; No Gods, No Masters; Once &amp; Future, Realms of Magic &amp; Mystery</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/369-geoffrey","name":"Geoffrey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-24T16:49:52-07:00","id":1477284,"title":"","content":"We allow swapping Knacks as a simple action that cannot be part of a mixed action, and it makes players much happier than picking in advance without letting them have tons active at once.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-24T17:36:37-07:00","id":1477289,"title":"","content":"One frequent rule I saw mentioned many times is to allow Knack swapping during a scene by spending momentum.<br /> <br /> It gives some meaning to the initial picking of active Knacks, gives meaning to the ton of knacks you pick with XP (as most of the powers are free/locked to Legend), gives meaning to the number of active Knacks and gives the option of swapping active during the scene.<br /> <br /> Also, free swapping active knacks between scenes is a great option, even if you don\u2019t like the idea of swapping during the scene. I have this option so deep in my mind I was even thinking it was the regular rules (swapping between scenes and not between sessions).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-26T02:34:17-07:00","id":1477424,"title":"","content":"Thanks a lot for the feedback.<br /> I was pretty sure of the Immortal Knacks taking up 2 slots and the rule that Knacks needed to relate to Calling dots, but I can't find it in the books. So I thought it might be leeps of logic.<br /> <br /> The few times it has been relevant, I let my players spend 2 Momentum to switch a Knack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}